  "description": "<p data-path-to-node=\"1\"><b data-path-to-node=\"1\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Premium Handwoven Rattan Charger Plate – Natural Core Rattan</b></p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"2\">Elevate your tableware collection with our <b data-path-to-node=\"2\" data-index-in-node=\"43\">Premium Handwoven Rattan Charger Plate</b>, designed specifically for high-end hospitality brands, event planners, and luxury home decor retailers. Crafted with meticulous attention to detail, this charger plate brings an effortless blend of organic texture, artisanal craftsmanship, and modern elegance to any dining setting.</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"3\"><b data-path-to-node=\"3\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Product Overview</b></p>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"4\">\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"4,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"4,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">100% Natural Core Rattan:</b> Made exclusively from selected natural rattan core, offering a smoother finish, superior flexibility, and exceptional structural durability compared to standard rattan.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"4,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"4,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Artisanal Handcraftsmanship:</b> Each piece is 100% handwoven by skilled Vietnamese artisans. The intricate radial weave pattern demonstrates master-level technique, ensuring every plate is a unique work of art.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"4,2,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"4,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Luxury &amp; Commercial Grade:</b> Built to meet export-quality standards. The sturdy weave resists warping, making it ideal for frequent use in commercial environments like fine-dining restaurants, boutique hotels, and luxury weddings.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"4,3,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"4,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Versatile Styling:</b> Perfect as a decorative base plate for dinnerware, a stylish serving tray, or a bohemian wall accent.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"5\"><b data-path-to-node=\"5\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Technical Specifications</b></p>\n<table data-path-to-node=\"6\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Feature</strong></td>\n<td><strong>Specification</strong></td>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"6,1,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"6,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Material</b></span></td>\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"6,1,1,0\">100% Natural Rattan Core</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"6,2,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"6,2,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Craftsmanship</b></span></td>\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"6,2,1,0\">100% Handwoven</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"6,3,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"6,3,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Shape / Style</b></span></td>\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"6,3,1,0\">Round / Radial Basket Weave</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"6,4,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"6,4,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Color</b></span></td>\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"6,4,1,0\">Natural Warm Honey / Rattan Tone</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"6,5,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"6,5,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Usage</b></span></td>\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"6,5,1,0\">Fine Dining, Weddings, Hotels, Wholesale Home Decor</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"6,6,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"6,6,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Quality Control</b></span></td>\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"6,6,1,0\">Export Standard (Mold-treated, Eco-friendly coating)</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7\"><b data-path-to-node=\"7\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Why Partner With Us for Wholesale &amp; Import?</b></p>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"8\">\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"8,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Direct Manufacturer Pricing:</b> Competitive B2B pricing with scalable volume discounts to maximize your profit margins.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Flexible OEM/ODM Customization:</b> Custom sizes, custom stains/finishes, and private labeling available upon request.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Reliable Supply Chain:</b> Consistent production capacity and stringent quality inspection to guarantee timely shipments for large-volume orders.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
